---
title: A click on a short link
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant D as Decode service
  participant S as Link store
  participant Q as NSQ queue
  U->>D: opens bit.ly/xyz
  D->>S: look up destination
  S-->>D: long URL
  D-->>U: HTTP redirect
  D-)Q: publish click
  Note over D,Q: async, the user does not wait
